+   vx     vy     wz  ood                 FL                 FR                 RL                 RR
+ 0.50   0.00   0.00        1.20 / 0.31 / 18   1.15 / 0.30 / 17   0.62 / 0.17 / 6    0.66 / 0.18 / 7
+```
+(an illustration of the layout, not a measurement)
